(1696, 242, 'Which of the following is a data quality dimension?', 'Accuracy and completeness', 'File size', 'Table count', 'Query speed', 'A', 'Accuracy, completeness, and consistency measure data quality.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
