(1698, 242, 'Which ETL stage typically performs joins and aggregations?', 'Transformation', 'Extraction', 'Loading', 'Monitoring', 'A', 'Joins and aggregations reshape data during the transform step.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
