(1706, 242, 'What does data deduplication in ETL remove?', 'Duplicate records based on business keys', 'All historical data', 'All null values', 'Primary keys', 'A', 'Deduplication identifies and removes repeated records.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
