(1709, 242, 'What is the purpose of an ETL log and audit trail?', 'To record what ran, what changed, and any errors', 'To replace the warehouse', 'To store reports', 'To hide data sources', 'A', 'Audit logs provide traceability and aid troubleshooting.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
