(1714, 243, 'What does roll-up do in OLAP?', 'Aggregates data up a hierarchy to a higher level', 'Drills into detail', 'Slices the cube', 'Deletes data', 'A', 'Roll-up climbs the hierarchy, e.g., from month to quarter.', 'BEGINNER', 1, 'MCQ', 1),
