(1761, 244, 'What is the main challenge of class imbalance in classification?', 'Models favor the majority class and miss minority cases', 'Models run faster', 'Data is smaller', 'Labels are cleaner', 'A', 'Imbalanced data biases models toward the dominant class.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
