(1781, 245, 'What is the main advantage of the Apriori pruning principle?', 'If an itemset is infrequent, all its supersets are infrequent', 'It explores all supersets', 'It ignores support', 'It requires no scans', 'A', 'This property lets Apriori prune the search space.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
(1782, 245, 'Which step reassigns points in each k-means iteration?', 'Assigning each point to the nearest centroid', 'Deleting points', 'Merging all clusters', 'Adding noise', 'A', 'Points move to the cluster with the closest centroid each iteration.', 'INTERMEDIATE', 2, 'MCQ', 1),
